OL,3,GNEWSAThe mystery of the saint, the Lord
OL,4,AMayor and the country house
OL,5,
OL,6,FErkenwald served as the Bishop of
OL,7,FLondon between 675 and 693. He was a
OL,8,Fnobleman who founded two great
OL,9,FAnglo-Saxon monasteries and gained a
OL,10,Freputation for healing rifts within the
OL,11,Fchurch, which led to his later
OL,12,Fcanonisation.
